3, "last_played": 1785272874, "avatar": "b93f04b9194fba8980a2dc74947d47d0087ba113"}, "language": "english", "review": "HARD GAME!!!!!!!", "timestamp_created": 1744701402, "timestamp_updated": 1744701402, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192779974", "author": {"steamid": "76561198063147403", "personaname": "PeoplePeephole", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198063147403/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1235, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 465, "last_played": 1749448029, "avatar": "43eb62791fa45a2206198a4c06b1eeb4b7737eac"}, "language": "english", "review": "Easy to drop in and have fun. Every run feels really unique, because the perks are random and you end up making wildly synergistic builds that you'll think back on nostalgically.\n\nFor example, I had a perk that would raise my baseline health from enemies dying in close proximity, as well as a perk that did AoE damage to enemies in close proximity. So I was just raking in extra baseline health whenever I was getting swarmed. I also got health from damaging enemies and would get money from damaging enemies. So things really started to snowball, where I'd buy out the shop like 3 times over, and healing was never an issue. Thinking about it brings a tear to my crabby eye.\n\nI thought of Destiny 2 sometimes with this build, I think because the season meta builds felt like this game feels. It's distilled Destiny 2 feels without all the fluff.", "timestamp_created": 1744696369, "timestamp_updated": 1745020780, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}]}